{
  "name": "VeyCall: Messenger",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "291e55a9-de52-5747-85c9-ae8f4bd7c112",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VeyCall: Messenger\n\nYour VeyCall agent answers your Facebook Page's Messenger messages.\n\n1. In your Meta app, add *Messenger* and subscribe your Page to `messages`. Webhook callback URL: this workflow's **production URL**; verify token: the one you put in **Verify**.\n2. **Send reply**: create a *Header Auth* credential named **Facebook Page token** (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer <page access token>`).\n3. **VeyCall node**: create a *VeyCall API* credential with your organization API key (`vc_live_…`, VeyCall dashboard; needs the *API and webhooks* activation), then pick your agent.\n4. Activate.\n\nMeta allows free replies within 24 hours of the customer's last message. The same pattern works for Instagram messages (Instagram messaging webhook and the Graph API).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 500,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1c2b2d2d-f946-5361-98ca-17f8ccc7cbeb",
      "name": "Messenger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "multipleMethods": true,
        "httpMethod": [
          "GET",
          "POST"
        ],
        "path": "veycall-messenger",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "veycall-messenger"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f60c118-1fb1-525b-809d-1e8964c95450",
      "name": "Verify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.query['hub.verify_token'] === 'REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_VERIFY_TOKEN' ? $json.query['hub.challenge'] : 'forbidden' }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e67b1dbb-30a5-5f8d-bd47-a7554cd1f721",
      "name": "OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ec23abb-46f7-5015-aba7-7844afba247a",
      "name": "Read messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Messenger webhook events -> one item per customer message (echoes of the page's own messages are skipped).\nconst out = [];\nfor (const entry of $json.body?.entry ?? []) {\n  for (const e of entry.messaging ?? []) {\n    if (!e.message || e.message.is_echo || !e.message.text) continue;\n    out.push({ json: { psid: e.sender.id, page: e.recipient.id, mid: e.message.mid, text: e.message.text.slice(0, 8000) } });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "205ff145-43fc-50f0-b351-7991a9f971fe",
      "name": "VeyCall answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-veycall.veyCall",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "answer",
        "agentId": "",
        "channel": "messenger",
        "conversationId": "={{ $json.psid }}",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.mid }}",
        "senderId": "={{ $json.psid }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "audioSource": "none",
        "replyAs": "text",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ccaae94-9280-56ce-b36a-38475cd686b1",
      "name": "Reply to send?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dcfaad0a-33be-50fa-a7c3-e87c23740dbf",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.reply?.text ?? '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "55f1269c-d9f0-5635-902e-50687b5ccaa0",
      "name": "Send reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/me/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ recipient: { id: $('Read messages').item.json.psid }, messaging_type: 'RESPONSE', message: { text: $json.reply.text } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Messenger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Verify",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "OK",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OK": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read messages",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read messages": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "VeyCall answers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "VeyCall answers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reply to send?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Reply to send?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Your VeyCall AI agent answers your Facebook Page's Messenger messages."
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
